ts/steam/apps/2304600/extras/526895752415f58b9c92443097fa7361.avif?t=1720780510\" /></span><br><br>\tYou only need to beat one or two levels in each category to unlock the next, which allows players from all skill levels to easily progress through the game and explore the different themes and game mechanics.<br><br>\tMost levels are designed to be solvable in anything from five to thirty minutes but if you want to compete for the best possible scores you can expect to spend hours on each level in order to find the ultimate solution. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2304600/extras/d21b3c7daf102f5b5daa8c79e86a73f7.webp?t=1720780510\" /></span><br>Each level can have up to three leaderboards, allowing you to compete with your Steam friends or push yourself towards a world record for ultimate glory. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2304600/extras/8eb7a6547de270fa32df31be9512f6f9.webp?t=1720780510\" /></span><br>\tEvery level was built using the game's super easy to use level editor. A single click of a button can allow you to begin editing the level you are currently playing or to start a brand new one from scratch. <br><br>\tChoose an arena, choose a location, choose from hundreds of block shapes, drag and drop them wherever you like, and start playing your creation instantly right there in the editor. A couple of clicks and you've added a new goal zone. A couple of drags and you resized and moved it to the perfect position.<br><br>\tWant a new wall here or there? No problem. Click click. <br>\tWant a drop zone here, or to change a block to a different type? No problem. Click click. <br><br>\t<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2304600/extras/ce9ad990ed47fe8